text":"公孫彊言霸說於曹伯。十四年，曹伯從之，乃背晉干宋。宋景公伐之，晉人不救。十五年，宋滅曹，執曹伯陽及公孫彊以歸而殺之。曹遂絕其祀。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m042-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"公孫彊","kind":"person","person_id":"j2k_9wg_9q8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m042-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"曹伯","kind":"person","person_id":"lcc_msq_vdt_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m042-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"曹伯","kind":"person","person_id":"lcc_msq_vdt_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m042-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"宋景公","kind":"person","person_id":"jm9_oxb_y3l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m042-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"曹伯陽","kind":"person","person_id":"lcc_msq_vdt_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m042-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"公孫彊","kind":"person","person_id":"j2k_9wg_9q8","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","book_id":"b-shiji-035","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:p043","text":"太史公曰：余尋曹共公之不用僖負羈，乃乘軒者三百人，知唯德之不建。及振鐸之夢，豈不欲引曹之祀者哉？如公孫彊不修厥政，叔鐸之祀忽諸。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m043-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定稱呼、國別指代或數位校勘字樣；不補人名、成員與闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m043-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"余","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定稱呼、國別指代或數位校勘字樣；不補人名、成員與闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m043-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"曹共公","kind":"person","person_id":"vs4_n7e_1qh_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-035-guancai:m043-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"僖負羈","kind":"person","person_id":"pft_5o1_zzt","status":"contextual_provis